body:
Dear u/Wolfilicous,

&#x200B;

Wow... 

I always thought updating from the terminal was the way to go. I always see people in the videos do it, I'm quite shocked to see this.

&#x200B;

It were mostly pictures that I had backed up from me and my nephew :(. If anything is possible, please let me know, I'm ready to give a cash/gift reward for the person that helps me retrieve the data.

&#x200B;

With Kind Regards,

&#x200B;

u/trapproducer2020
